    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the heart of Ballinacarrow Village, this immaculately presented four-bedroom residence offers a superb blend of space, style, and practicality. Finished to a high standard throughout, the property has been exceptionally well maintained and boasts a modern contemporary interior designed to meet the needs of modern family living. The spacious accommodation extends over two levels and comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a bright and comfortable sitting room featuring a solid fuel stove, and a generous kitchen/dining area ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. A separate utility room and a convenient ground-floor shower room further enhance the practicality of the home.\nUpstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with en-suite facilities, together with a stylish family bathroom. Externally, the property benefits from a low-maintenance garden, providing an attractive outdoor space with minimal upkeep required, while private parking to the rear adds further convenience.\nThis turnkey home offers an excellent opportunity for families, first-time buyers, or those seeking village living in a modern and comfortable setting, within easy reach of local amenities and surrounding towns.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Mains water and sewer.\nFixed line broadband availability.\nDouble glazed windows and doors\nParking to the rear of the property.\nOil fired central heating and solid fuel stove\n\nMains - Electricity, Mains Sewerage, Telephone\n"
      },
      {
